odotengine/godot/pull/101535#issuecomment-2589818529","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101535","id":2589818529,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aXX6h","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-14T12:43:35Z","updated_at":"2025-01-14T12:45:51Z","body":"Yes, the other locks need to stay, else we crash again with user pathfinding threads like we did in Godot 4.2 when the map changes and invalidates all the pointers. This only removes the outer function locks because they all call the internal get_closest_point_info() function that also read locks the same lock.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2589818529/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2624284503","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101535#issuecomment-2624284503","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101